WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:05.470
Speaker 1: All right, let's do a lesson here
in dishonesty, propaganda, lying with statistics,

00:00:05.470 --> 00:00:07.009
a bunch of other stuff.

00:00:07.009 --> 00:00:12.500
I have a graphic that I'm going to show you
that I believe is at least a top contender

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:15.679
for the most dishonest graphic ever shown
on Fox News.

00:00:15.679 --> 00:00:20.810
And it's dishonest, probably in three to four
different ways.

00:00:20.810 --> 00:00:23.010
OK, here's the graphic.

00:00:23.010 --> 00:00:27.510
As you can see, it's from Sean Hannity's Fox
News program last night.

00:00:27.510 --> 00:00:31.910
This is really instructive in terms of propaganda
in line with statistics.

00:00:31.910 --> 00:00:38.149
The graphic is part of a segment wanting to
blame Joe Biden for COVID deaths.

00:00:38.149 --> 00:00:41.429
It was a segment about how bad Joe Biden is.

00:00:41.429 --> 00:00:47.019
And of course, the hypocrisy is incredible
because these very same people didn't really

00:00:47.019 --> 00:00:51.179
care about the COVID death numbers when Donald
Trump was president that in fact, they went

00:00:51.179 --> 00:00:55.390
out of their way to apologize for Trump and
claim he's doing a great job.

00:00:55.390 --> 00:00:57.819
And Covid's not that serious and all of that
stuff.

00:00:57.819 --> 00:01:06.081
So the claim here is is just comparing COVID
deaths in 2020 to COVID deaths in 2021 and

00:01:06.081 --> 00:01:09.770
making it seem that Joe Biden is worse than
Trump.

00:01:09.770 --> 00:01:16.740
Now, what the graphic says or shows is that
in 2020, three hundred and fifty two thousand

00:01:16.740 --> 00:01:20.690
people died of COVID, whereas in 2020, one.

00:01:20.690 --> 00:01:23.090
Three hundred and seventy two thousand people
died of COVID.

00:01:23.090 --> 00:01:24.970
So the point here is 2020.

00:01:24.970 --> 00:01:30.960
Under Trump, three hundred and fifty two thousand
COVID deaths 2021 not even in the full year

00:01:30.960 --> 00:01:35.490
under Biden, more deaths by about 20000.

00:01:35.490 --> 00:01:41.670
So let's consider the ways that this is dishonest,
and I'm not doing this to score points for

00:01:41.670 --> 00:01:43.720
one team or another.

00:01:43.720 --> 00:01:48.860
It's about understanding whether you are being
honestly given information and what you should

00:01:48.860 --> 00:01:49.860
deduce from it.

00:01:49.860 --> 00:01:57.030
So first of all, Donald Trump was president
the first three weeks of 2021.

00:01:57.030 --> 00:02:02.910
During those first three weeks of 2021, about
72000 Americans died of COVID.

00:02:02.910 --> 00:02:09.719
So right off the bat, despite this graphic
of these deaths.

00:02:09.719 --> 00:02:16.200
Four hundred and 24000 happened when Trump
was president and 300000 happened while Joe

00:02:16.200 --> 00:02:17.200
Biden was president.

00:02:17.200 --> 00:02:22.480
So like without even debating the merits of
whether this entire exercise makes any sense.

00:02:22.480 --> 00:02:28.340
The by President Donald Trump actually was
president during one hundred and twenty four

00:02:28.340 --> 00:02:31.140
thousand more COVID deaths than Joe Biden.

00:02:31.140 --> 00:02:32.739
This is actually pretty dumb.

00:02:32.739 --> 00:02:36.459
I'm not going to even say this is a this is
an intelligent thing to do.

00:02:36.459 --> 00:02:41.390
There are lots of people, for example, that
died in February when Biden was president,

00:02:41.390 --> 00:02:44.129
but who caught the virus when Trump was president.

00:02:44.129 --> 00:02:45.800
Who gets the blame for that death?

00:02:45.800 --> 00:02:47.140
It's sort of a weird metric.

00:02:47.140 --> 00:02:51.450
It's not very useful, but by the standards
of the people making the graphics, it could

00:02:51.450 --> 00:02:58.010
say four hundred and twenty four thousand
dead dead under Trump, 300000 dead under Biden.

00:02:58.010 --> 00:03:00.230
That paints a completely different picture.

00:03:00.230 --> 00:03:02.549
That's a layer of dishonesty, number one.

00:03:02.549 --> 00:03:04.530
Second layer of dishonesty.

00:03:04.530 --> 00:03:09.659
The deaths didn't really start in the United
States until April of 2020.

00:03:09.659 --> 00:03:10.900
OK.

00:03:10.900 --> 00:03:15.019
In the last 10 days of March 2020, we saw
deaths go up.

00:03:15.019 --> 00:03:21.750
So even in comparing these numbers and thinking
about them as Trump versus Biden, Trump kind

00:03:21.750 --> 00:03:25.279
of had a freebie for January of 2020.

00:03:25.279 --> 00:03:28.171
February 2020 March, most of March of 2020.

00:03:28.171 --> 00:03:31.209
Now, some will say, David, there were deaths
in those months.

00:03:31.209 --> 00:03:34.140
We just didn't know that they were COVID,
yet they were called pneumonia or something

00:03:34.140 --> 00:03:35.140
else.

00:03:35.140 --> 00:03:37.469
That's the point is they're not in the numbers,
OK?

00:03:37.469 --> 00:03:44.129
So in the Biden category there, including
the first three weeks of 2021 when Biden wasn't

00:03:44.129 --> 00:03:51.310
even president, plus more months overall since
we have about nine weeks left this year, and

00:03:51.310 --> 00:03:56.640
Trump really only had eight months worth of
deaths in 2020.

00:03:56.640 --> 00:04:00.249
So that's another level of dishonesty for
what is a very stupid exercise.

00:04:00.249 --> 00:04:01.249
All right.

00:04:01.249 --> 00:04:02.540
That that's another one.

00:04:02.540 --> 00:04:06.319
But now let me get to the really dishonest
part of this.

00:04:06.319 --> 00:04:14.590
The deaths, even in 2021, even today, are
mostly overwhelmingly the unvaccinated who

00:04:14.590 --> 00:04:16.970
were mostly Trump supporting Republicans.

00:04:16.970 --> 00:04:24.259
So is it really Joe Biden's fault that Trump
supporters have been bamboozled into not wanting

00:04:24.259 --> 00:04:27.949
the vaccine by other right wingers and they
are dying?

00:04:27.949 --> 00:04:30.699
For me, that's the real dishonesty here.

00:04:30.699 --> 00:04:35.419
And of course, there's this highly contagious
Delta variant, which plague the planet in

00:04:35.419 --> 00:04:36.419
2021.

00:04:36.419 --> 00:04:37.419
That's not Trump's fault.

00:04:37.419 --> 00:04:38.419
It's not Joe Biden's fault.

00:04:38.419 --> 00:04:43.970
Although more vaccination would have slowed
down the mutation, as Vincent Racaniello and

00:04:43.970 --> 00:04:49.569
others have told us, so a ton of this stuff,
it's like it's kind of ticky tacky, as we

00:04:49.569 --> 00:04:50.780
might say in sports.

00:04:50.780 --> 00:04:55.510
Well, there's these three weeks and in January
when when Trump was still president.

00:04:55.510 --> 00:05:01.000
But when do the deaths really become under
the watch of one president versus when the

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:03.270
deaths happen when the person got sick?

00:05:03.270 --> 00:05:04.270
It's tough.

00:05:04.270 --> 00:05:05.270
It's nebulous.

00:05:05.270 --> 00:05:11.720
It's not particularly meaningful, comparing
11 months for Biden to eight months for Trump.

00:05:11.720 --> 00:05:13.479
That's also dishonest.

00:05:13.479 --> 00:05:19.220
But the real dishonesty is that they do all
this stuff while ignoring that the deaths

00:05:19.220 --> 00:05:22.500
are higher because of right wing anti-vaxxers.

00:05:22.500 --> 00:05:27.150
And it's more right wingers than left wingers
all along who were participating in behaviors

00:05:27.150 --> 00:05:28.639
that spread the virus.

00:05:28.639 --> 00:05:31.350
And also, this is a subtle attack on vaccination.

00:05:31.350 --> 00:05:36.580
We shouldn't ignore that we are far more vaccinated
now than in 2020.

00:05:36.580 --> 00:05:40.819
And that was the theme yesterday on Fox News,
in part thanks to the death of Colin Powell,

00:05:40.819 --> 00:05:47.979
who, as we already talked about, was fully
vaccinated but 84 years old, immunocompromised

00:05:47.979 --> 00:05:49.810
Parkinson's cancer.

00:05:49.810 --> 00:05:52.300
So it's incredibly dishonest.

00:05:52.300 --> 00:05:57.120
It's important to spot this stuff, and sometimes
there's kind of two analyzes that need to

00:05:57.120 --> 00:05:58.509
be done.

00:05:58.509 --> 00:06:03.350
One is we just look at the numbers and we
think through, OK, wait, so who was president

00:06:03.350 --> 00:06:04.449
in 2020?

00:06:04.449 --> 00:06:05.449
How many death?

00:06:05.449 --> 00:06:06.610
OK, let's think about that.

00:06:06.610 --> 00:06:10.590
When did death start to even be counted in
2020?

00:06:10.590 --> 00:06:11.970
We have to think about all of that.

00:06:11.970 --> 00:06:16.879
But then there's the big dishonesty, which
is the ways in which these numbers are being

00:06:16.879 --> 00:06:21.740
used to make political statements that don't
actually follow from the numbers and ignore

00:06:21.740 --> 00:06:25.650
who it is that's keeping people from being
vaccinated in the first place.

00:06:25.650 --> 00:06:28.199
So up there, up there?

00:06:28.199 --> 00:06:33.289
One of the most dishonest graphics I've seen
on Fox News, when you really break it down

00:06:33.289 --> 00:06:33.580
and think it through,

